the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 10.

the actions are:
    the order with id *an id* and state *a state* ends; known as order_ends.
    the state of the order with id *an id* becomes *a state*; known as order_state_becomes.
    a shipment starts for *an order*; known as shipment_starts.
    the level of the stock becomes *a level*; known as stock_level_becomes.

the fluents are:
    there is an order with id *an id* and state *a state*; known as order.
    there is a stock with level *a level*; known as stock.
    there is a shipment for *an order*; known as shipment.

the knowledge base shipping includes:

the text of the rule base is at "sources/shipping.drl".

% Rule "an order with stock ships"
if there is an order with id an id and state placed
    and there is a stock with level available
then a shipment starts for the id
    and the state of the order with id the id becomes shipped
    and the level of the stock becomes low.

when a shipment starts for an order
then there is a shipment for the order.

when the state of the order with id an id becomes shipped
then there is an order with id the id and state shipped
    and it is not the case that there is an order with id the id and state placed.

when the level of the stock becomes low
then there is a stock with level low
    and it is not the case that there is a stock with level available.

% Rule "a shipped order is no longer pending"
if there is an order with id an id and state shipped
    and there is a shipment for the id
then the order with id the id and state shipped ends.

when the order with id an id and state shipped ends
then it is not the case that there is an order with id the id and state shipped.

initially there is an order with id o1 and state placed
    and there is a stock with level available.

% Drools (a KieSession on the same working memory and steps) fired 2 rule(s) and ended with
% (its facts as this twin's fluents):
%   - shipment(o1)
%   - stock(low)
% The twin's final state under LPS2 (`lps state`) is compared with it by test_drools.pl.
